## Goal

Generate the requested course scene PNG at `course-assets/scenes/module-12/m12_L12A_b11_offers-made.png`.

## Scope

- Use the supplied BMH course doodle style references.
- Create one PNG at 1600 x 900.
- Show a clean acquisition-side offer desk scene with no people.
- Include a blank lead packet folder entering from the left, a simple calculator, a property photo represented by a plain little house drawing with no labels, and one blank official offer sheet on the right with only generic pseudo-lines.
- Leave generous open cornflower-blue space around the desk for later code-rendered counters.
- Use flat sticker-sheet style, thick wobble black outlines, rounded simple shapes, and the locked course palette.
- Avoid text, labels, numbers, logos, people, charts, speech bubbles, thought bubbles, ambient doodles, gradients, texture, shadows, lighting, and perspective depth.

## Verification

- Confirm the file exists at the requested path.
- Confirm the file is PNG and 1600 x 900.
- Confirm palette is flat and close to the locked course colors.
- Visually inspect for no people, requested desk objects, no baked text or numbers, no decorative filler, and enough open blue margin for code overlays.
