+
+# Generate m18 L18B b12 wins momentum scene asset
+
+## Goal
+
+Generate the requested course scene PNG at `course-assets/scenes/module-18-lesson18B/m18_L18B_b12_wins-momentum.png`.
+
+## Scope
+
+- Use the supplied BMH course doodle style references.
+- Create one PNG at 1600 x 900.
+- Show a team win momentum scene on a plain cornflower-blue field.
+- Center a blank team channel board with one larger blank celebration post card and two smaller blank win cards.
+- Include exactly three BMH-style team members total, smiling professionally and looking at the board.
+- Keep celebration restrained with one small raised hand or nod.
+- Include a simple upward momentum meter shape beside the board with no numbers or labels.
+- Keep top-center open for later code labels.
+- Use flat sticker-sheet doodle style, thick wobble black outlines, rounded simple shapes, and the locked course palette.
+- Avoid confetti, sparkles, hearts, ambient doodles, decorative clutter, real app logos, readable text, letters, words, numbers, labels, captions, UI labels, and readable paperwork.
+
+## Verification
+
+- Confirm the file exists at the requested path.
+- Confirm the file is PNG and 1600 x 900.
+- Confirm palette is flat and close to the locked course colors.
+- Visually inspect for exactly three people, blank channel board/cards, no baked text or numbers, no ambient doodles, no extra props, and open top-center blue space for overlays.

